      "created_at": "2015-04-18T00:49:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This won't be the last one for me</p><p>And it won't be the last one you see</p><p>But please say farewell</p><p>to the poems so swell</p><p>I won't be posting them with such regularity</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Well, it's been a lot of fun posting in limericks, but I'm startting to get limericked out. &nbsp;My rhymes are repeating constantly, and I'm no longer enjoying the extra effort. &nbsp;So farewell to a limerick in every post!</p>",
